    "Helix is a continuation of enzo by ParkerBritt, whose engine, node system and attribute model remain its foundation. Both are released under the MIT licence.\n\n3D files are read with Assimp (BSD 3-Clause, with Draco, Apache 2.0) and Model I/O.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Helix is a continuation of enzo by ParkerBritt, whose engine, node system and attribute model remain its foundation. Both are released under the MIT licence.\n\n3D files are read with Assimp (BSD 3-Clause, with Draco, Apache 2.0) and Model I/O."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Helix prolonge enzo, de ParkerBritt, dont le moteur, le système de nœuds et le modèle d’attributs restent sa base. Les deux sont publiés sous licence MIT.\n\nLes fichiers 3D sont lus avec Assimp (BSD 3-Clause, avec Draco, Apache 2.0) et Model I/O."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Helix opens one scene at a time for now.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
